---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-[#262626] bg-[#0a0a0a] py-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
		<div>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-100 font-mono font-bold text-sm tracking-wider">
				<span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#ccff00]"></span>
				<span>FASTCHAT ROOM</span>
			</div>
			<p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono mt-1">
